---
import BookingStatus from '../../BookingStatus.astro';
---

<section class="inner-hero" aria-labelledby="contact-title"><div class="section-shell inner-hero__grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">CONTACT</p><h1 id="contact-title">Let's get<br /><span>you moving.</span></h1></div><div class="inner-hero__aside"><p class="hero-lede">Have a question about physical therapy, your recovery, or whether Forge is the right fit for you? We're here to help.</p><p>If you're ready to get started, the fastest way is to book an evaluation.</p><BookingStatus /></div></div></section>

  <section class="contact-main surface-light" aria-labelledby="contact-form-title"><div class="section-shell contact-main__grid">
    <div class="contact-form-copy"><p class="eyebrow">HAVE A QUESTION?</p><h2 id="contact-form-title">We'd love to hear from you.</h2><p>Whether you're not sure where to start, have a question about services, or want to learn more about how Forge works, send us a message.</p><p class="contact-privacy">Please do not include sensitive medical information in this form.</p></div>
    <form class="contact-form" aria-label="Contact Forge demo form">
      <label>Name<input type="text" name="name" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Your Name" /></label>
      <label>Email<input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="Your Email" /></label>
      <label>Phone<input type="tel" name="phone" autocomplete="tel" placeholder="Your Phone" /></label>
      <label class="contact-form__full">What can we help you with?<select name="interest"><option value="">Select an option</option><option>I'm interested in physical therapy</option><option>I'm recovering from surgery</option><option>I'm interested in sports rehabilitation</option><option>I'm interested in strength &amp; performance</option><option>I have a question about pricing</option><option>I'm not sure if Forge is right for me</option><option>Other</option></select></label>
      <label class="contact-form__full">Message<textarea name="message" rows="6" placeholder="Tell us a little about what you're looking for"></textarea></label>
      <div class="contact-form__full contact-form__submit"><button type="button">Send Message</button><span>Demo form · message delivery will be connected before launch.</span></div>
    </form>
  </div></section>

  <section class="contact-direct" aria-labelledby="direct-title"><div class="section-shell"><header class="interior-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">PREFER TO REACH OUT DIRECTLY?</p><h2 id="direct-title">Choose the way that works for you.</h2></div><p>Brandon hasn't supplied the final clinic phone, email, location, or hours yet, so the demo keeps those values explicit instead of inventing them.</p></header><div class="contact-cards"><article><span>01</span><h3>Phone</h3><p>Phone number coming soon</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Email</h3><p>Email address coming soon</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Location</h3><p>Forge Rehab &amp; Performance</p><p>Gym name coming soon</p><p>Address coming soon</p></article><article><span>04</span><h3>Hours</h3><p>Hours coming soon</p></article></div></div></section>

  <section class="contact-location surface-light" aria-labelledby="location-title"><div class="section-shell contact-location__grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">FIND US</p><h2 id="location-title">Your rehab. Your training environment.</h2><p>Forge Rehab &amp; Performance is located inside the clinic's partner gym, giving you access to a real training environment where rehabilitation can progress naturally from recovery to strength and performance.</p><p class="contact-location__placeholder">Map and directions will appear here once the gym name and address are finalized.</p></div><div class="map-placeholder" aria-label="Future map location"><img src="/assets/hero_barbell.jpg" width="896" height="1200" alt="" /><span>Location details coming soon</span></div></div></section>

  <section class="home-v3-close" aria-labelledby="contact-close-title"><div class="section-shell home-v3-close__grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">NOT SURE IF FORGE IS RIGHT FOR YOU?</p><h2 id="contact-close-title">That's okay.</h2><p>You don't need to know exactly what service you need before reaching out. Start with a conversation or book an evaluation, and we'll figure out the right next step together.</p></div><BookingStatus /></div></section>
